      'Opening deal: 4-4 player(s), 10 card(s) per player, 1 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in ante; each_player_clockwise may use ante before deal.',
      "Scoring check: Stake-based. Hombre wins: takes pool and premiums (Solo, Matadors, Premiers). Hombre loses: Remise (5 tricks) = double pool; Codille (4 or fewer) = stiffer penalty. Bonuses: Premiers (six tricks before opponents take one), Matadors (top trumps held). Expected outcome: Hombre (or Hombre's team) wins by taking six or more tricks. Loses with five (Remise) or four or fewer (Codille)..",
